Dellix used the spell in the [[Casterwill Library]] whilst fighting [[Lok Lambert]], allowing Dellix to overpower the [[Willblade]]. Dellix later used it whilst fighting a [[Suit]], enabling his sword to cut cleanly through an [[Organization]] [[Sedan]]. {{source|Chasing Void}}

During the battle outside the [[Fortress of Iron Will]], Dellix used the spell against the [[Silent Soldiers]]. {{source|The Spiral War}}
